WEBVTT

00:00.400 --> 00:06.160
Open Home, then Reminders. The task screen keeps household to dos together. Use it

00:06.160 --> 00:11.849
for jobs such as buying supplies, taking out the bins, or preparing for tomorrow.

00:15.400 --> 00:21.080
Tap the add button. Enter a short, clear title. Set a due date or assign a household

00:21.080 --> 00:25.273
member when needed. Check the details, then save the reminder.

00:30.400 --> 00:35.819
Return to Today to review tasks that are due or overdue. Open a task when you need to

00:35.819 --> 00:39.708
make changes. Complete it when the work is actually finished.

00:45.400 --> 00:50.394
Apple Reminders integration is optional. Enable it through Apple connections and

00:50.394 --> 00:55.700
review the chosen list and permissions. A local household task is not automatically a

00:55.700 --> 00:57.511
reminder in every Apple list.
